        '**What:** tick **3D model (fast format, with its linked models)** and choose the detail: **Coarse (lightest)**, **Medium (recommended)** or **Fine (most detail)**. Tick **Sheets** and choose **All sheets**, **A Revit sheet set**, or **These sheets**. **Keep sheets published before** keeps earlier sheets that are not in this choice.',
