        '**Models and sheets:** the viewer projects (export folders) that show this job. Ctrl+click several when a job has several Revit models and sheet sets, such as Site 1 and Site 2. Choosing one already used elsewhere moves it here; an entry the server made for it alone is removed, and its task groups move with it.',
